{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p15871-595f8bb5e04cb87db3c4","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"예언에 대해…","speaker":"","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14684998588147312409"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-0d9072cedfe5c7600bd2","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"좋습니다. 아는 건 다 대답해드릴게요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17549561267356766882"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-ef0928e50f8a9e0c3ec5","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"이 석판들은 대체 뭘까요?","speaker":"","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["9283683665444006028"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-23523c05a65f6d12d72c","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"귀빈께서 이렇게 많은 도움을 주셨으니, 솔직히 말씀드릴게요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6157375798623765304"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-32df9083ab4df3de1301","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"분쟁기에 쿠마라는 예언가와 몇 번 마주친 적이 있습니다. 그녀는 개인적인 이익을 위해 예언을 이용한 적이 단 한 번도 없었지만, 이단으로 낙인찍혀 모든 작품은 폐기되었으며, 이름마저 지워졌죠","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8122083442010605265"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-d1605d7c7f194d032c6c","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"일설에 따르면 그녀는 자신의 연구를 비밀스러운 방식으로 보존했다고 해요. 그리고 그것들을 앰포리어스 곳곳에 퍼뜨렸다죠. 이 석판들은 아마 그녀의 작품일 거예요… 하지만 몇몇 디테일은 해석하기 어렵네요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6797127317318445944"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-1419935218a010affbda","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"제가 알기로 그녀는 황금의 후예가 아니에요. 그 영혼 역시 진작 타나토스의 품에 안겼고요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13613591005841149284"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-8f08fe64f72792908e45","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"석판의 내용은 제게 아무런 의미가 없습니다——신탁을 따르고 불씨를 사냥하는 것 외에 앰포리어스를 구할 방법은 없어요. 하지만 이 고대 유물을 지금까지 보존한 방법은 제법 궁금하네요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13898157230043554045"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-9dc4c114c0c44a0c9918","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"이전의 연구 덕분에 단서를 좀 얻긴 했지만, 더 많은 단편을 밝혀내야만 검증할 수 있어요. 그러니 앞으로도 잘 부탁드릴게요, 귀빈님","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2170564650702480444"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-4fd66e6de3feb02771ae","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"예언을 추구하는 이유가 뭐예요?","speaker":"","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10421328920920919682"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-ee86bc745ff38a8ebfce","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"흥미로운 질문이네요, 귀빈님. 우선 말씀드리죠. 예언은 미래만을 위한 게 아니에요. 때론 단서를 주고, 아무도 모르는 진실을 밝히기도 해요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16960486659438484787"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-507a85db89ee751d681a","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"오로닉스의 사제는 예언 점괘로 잃어버린 물건을 찾고, 야누스의 사제는 예언으로 미궁에서 빠져나올 수 있어요. 탈란톤의 사제는 예언으로 누명을 씻을 수 있죠……","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3829654432897150439"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-3acc90517caf8eb1b7db","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"보세요. 예언에는 다양한 용도가 있지만, 예언을 해독하는 건 제 가장 큰 목표가 아니에요. 기껏해야 대충 흩뿌리는 씨앗 정도라고 할 수 있죠","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16645981916027564078"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-5c3e2f3c61c47b2ca8c5","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"약충 자체야말로 가장 소중한 힘이에요. 그들을 길들이는 게 예언을 해독하는 것보다 중요해요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10691498941688267778"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-527df7d5f4cec3d76bb5","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"이 「낭만」의 나비들을 보세요. 귀엽지만 정말 연약한 존재죠…. 제게 선택권이 있다면 전 갑충이 될 거예요","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6576235116253588468"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-e81f8dbb319613ab8f83","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"진전이 어떤가요?","speaker":"","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14557068988056903835"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-83c4039404c2a69821aa","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"귀빈님이 전에 수집해 주신 석판 덕분에 금실이 더 명확한 방향을 알려줄 수 있게 되었습니다","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16380606554806204037"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-f81e81dbe7d99c7ccf7e","entryId":"other-npc-p15871","chapterId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","text":"이 석판들의 주인인 쿠마라는 예언가는 금기를 범했습니다. 그녀는 과거 「낭만」의 권능에 손을 대 자신을 약충으로 만들고 타나토스의 손아귀에서 달아나려 했죠","speaker":"의상공","mission":"「의상공」","scene":"NPC 대사 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17841123360110897621"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11280859373465541729","14152909093376111547","977300310163143285","2683028823826372179","17838541908732717749"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p15871","title":"「의상공」","page":"「衣匠」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p15871-595f8bb5e04cb87db3c4","rowId":"other-npc-p15871-595f8bb5e04cb87db3c4","missionId":"npc-p15871","mission":"「의상공」","sceneId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","scene":"NPC 대사 5","contextId":"wiki-context-cb020da5fc870b24c371fbd5","page":"「衣匠」","revision":99848,"location":[0,0,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["d9aab842afde-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15871-0d9072cedfe5c7600bd2"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-0d9072cedfe5c7600bd2","rowId":"other-npc-p15871-0d9072cedfe5c7600bd2","missionId":"npc-p15871","mission":"「의상공」","sceneId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","scene":"NPC 대사 5","contextId":"wiki-context-cb020da5fc870b24c371fbd5","page":"「衣匠」","revision":99848,"location":[0,0,"reply",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["d9aab842afde-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15871-ef0928e50f8a9e0c3ec5","other-npc-p15871-4fd66e6de3feb02771ae","other-npc-p15871-e81f8dbb319613ab8f83"],"replyToIds":["other-npc-p15871-595f8bb5e04cb87db3c4"],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-ef0928e50f8a9e0c3ec5","rowId":"other-npc-p15871-ef0928e50f8a9e0c3ec5","missionId":"npc-p15871","mission":"「의상공」","sceneId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","scene":"NPC 대사 5","contextId":"wiki-context-cb020da5fc870b24c371fbd5","page":"「衣匠」","revision":99848,"location":[0,0,"reply",0,1,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["d9aab842afde-0","8d27f450199a-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15871-23523c05a65f6d12d72c"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p15871-23523c05a65f6d12d72c","rowId":"other-npc-p15871-23523c05a65f6d12d72c","missionId":"npc-p15871","mission":"「의상공」","sceneId":"sf907a953b2af8dac","scene":"NPC 대사 5","contextId":"wiki-context-cb020da5fc870b24c371fbd5","page":"「衣匠」","revision":99848,"location":[0,0,"reply",0,1,"reply",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["d9aab842afde-0","8d27f450199a-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p15871-32df9083ab4df3de1301"],"replyToIds":["other-npc-p15871-ef0928e50f8a9e0c3ec5"],"status":"wiki-display"